      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5cz",
          "text": "Being involved in a distracted driving accident can result in a complicated car insurance claims process. You will have to prove that the other driver was not paying enough attention to the road and that this is what caused your accident. You will need to demonstrate this to a car insurance company using clear and convincing evidence.",
          "marks": []
