    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5d5",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l5d2",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5d1",
          "text": "Unfortunately, a car insurance company will not want to offer you a fair payout. It may employ tactics such as making a low settlement offer in the hopes of pressuring you to accept right away. A ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5d3",
          "text": "Denver personal injury attorney",
          "marks": [
            "l5d2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5d4",
          "text": " can take over the insurance claim process for you while you focus on healing from serious injuries.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5d7",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5d6",
          "text": "A lawyer will know how to deal with insurance claims adjusters to ensure you are treated fairly. An attorney will investigate your car accident, search for evidence of distracted driving and strengthen your case by hiring experts, if necessary. An experienced attorney will have the power to negotiate for maximum compensation on your behalf.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5d9",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5d8",
          "text": "What Is Distracted Driving?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5db",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5da",
          "text": "It is dangerous to operate a motor vehicle without 100 percent of your attention on the driving task. If a driver is guilty of distracted driving, it means that he or she is focused on something other than driving. The three types of driver distraction are visual (the eyes leaving the road), manual (the hands leaving the steering wheel) and cognitive (the mind leaving the driving task).",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5dd",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5dc",
          "text": "Is Distracted Driving Illegal in Colorado?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5di",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l5df",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://leg.colorado.gov/content/distracted-driving-and-cell-phone-use#:~:text=Colorado%20law%20permits%20regular%20cell,internet)%20while%20behind%20the%20wheel."
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5de",
          "text": "While Colorado does not have a law specifically against distracted driving, it does have a ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5dg",
          "text": "cell phone law",
          "marks": [
            "l5df"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5dh",
          "text": ". Drivers are prohibited from manual entry on a cell phone while driving. This includes manipulating a handheld device to text or email. Adult drivers can use their cell phones to make phone calls while driving, but any driver under the age of 18 cannot (except in an emergency). If a distraction leads to traffic violations, the driver can also face legal consequences for reckless driving.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5dk",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5dj",
          "text": "What Are the Most Common Driver Distractions?",
