        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5dl",
          "text": "Distracted driving is a significant public safety concern. According to the ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5dn",
          "text": "National Highway Traffic Safety Administration (NHTSA)",
          "marks": [
            "l5dm"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5do",
          "text": ", distracted driving claimed 3,308 lives in 2022. All types of distractions can be dangerous and result in serious automobile accidents in Denver.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
